---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" channel={4} description="About Nabil Luqman (frus), game designer and Unity developer.">
  <div class="screen-page">
    <h1>CH04 // ABOUT</h1>
    <p class="dim">NABIL LUQMAN · a.k.a. FRUS · Malaysia (UTC+8)</p>

    <div class="about-layout">
    <!-- PS2 look is baked into the PNG by scripts/ps2-image.mjs (160px,
         16-bit colour + dither). CSS shows it at 2x with crisp pixels. -->
    <figure class="portrait">
      <span class="rec" aria-hidden="true">REC ● SUBJ-00</span>
      <img src="/portrait-ps2.png" width="160" height="160" alt="Portrait of Nabil Luqman in a dark cardigan and tie" />
    </figure>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Game designer first, Unity developer by day. I like fast, skill-based action set in worlds that feel
        lived-in and a little bit wrong: soulslikes, character action, roguelikes, dark fantasy, cyberpunk.
      </p>
      <p>Right now I'm levelling up my code and my game art, and working toward my own game on Steam.</p>
      <p>Outside of games: cars, computers, and way too much tech news.</p>

      <h2>CONTACT</h2>
      <p>
        ✉ <a href="mailto:[YOUR EMAIL]">[YOUR EMAIL]</a><br />
        <a href="[ITCH URL]">itch.io</a> · <a href="[X / BLUESKY URL]">socials</a> · <a href="[LINKEDIN URL]">LinkedIn</a><br />
        <a href="/cv.pdf">Download CV (PDF)</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
